                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15160282" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 24 Feb 2016 06:48:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed, see one issue: in old code if &apos;onOwnerChanged&apos; returns &apos;false&apos; we try to notify others futures otherwise do &apos;return&apos;, for asynchronous notification &apos;return&apos; is missed and it does not handle case when &apos;onOwnerChanged&apos; returns &apos;false&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15166620" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 25 Feb 2016 02:47:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Moved the whole notification procedure in a separate method, calling this entire method either synchronously or from a separate thread.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15166621" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 25 Feb 2016 02:47:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master (a7b6ad36dd9b8f91877c614ce6e72c83ec1ffdf6)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
